Meta.documentation:Content-Type.image.gif
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The image/gif subtype. Bytes in through the octetstream interface
Meta.documentation:(the family's shared streaming contract — a future streaming
Meta.documentation:transport lands here once for every subtype). The typed output
